# git-mailmap — aliases the raw commit-author record for display.
# Does NOT rewrite history; only affects how `git log`, `git shortlog`,
# and GitHub's contributor UI display commit authors.
#
# Format: <canonical name> <canonical email> <legacy email>
# See https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap
#
# Enable once info@emburden.org is the intended canonical identity.
# Kept in place, unactivated, until then. Uncomment by removing the
# leading '#' on the line below.
#
# emburden project <info@emburden.org> <eric@scheier.org>
